    "backstory": "\"Loopy\" lived a sheltered life in the Rubbers Roost, always glued to outdated consoles. But when his flock was ambushed by rogue automatons during a Drip raid, his button-mashing reflexes became a weapon, turning glitches into offensive maneuvers. Now he has an ocular fallout that made him the clan's MVP.",
